{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/pradeepXkapoor/status/2103099194693271874","id":"2103099194693271874","text":"I asked @claudeai Opus 5.5 to make an animated video about a robot who realises he's stuck in an AI-generated world.\n\nI wanted to really push it: 12 worlds, 12 styles, from 8-bit to claymation to pencil sketch, you can really see how well this model has imagined all worlds. \n\nThis is the best animated video you will see today made by Opus 5.5, I promise.","raw_text":{"text":"I asked @claudeai Opus 5.5 to make an animated video about a robot who realises he's stuck in an AI-generated world.\n\nI wanted to really push it: 12 worlds, 12 styles, from 8-bit to claymation to pencil sketch, you can really see how well this model has imagined all worlds. \n\nThis is the best animated video you will see today made by Opus 5.5, I promise.","display_text_range":[0,356],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[8,17],"original":"claudeai","id":"1943306828697550848"},{"type":"media","indices":[275,298],"id":"2103099085012209664","display":"pic.x.com/V0EGuUKtaB","original":"https://t.co/V0EGuUKtaB","replacement":"https://x.com/pradeepXkapoor/status/2103099194693271874/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"pradeepXkapoor","url":"https://x.com/pradeepXkapoor","id":"1920544183925817345","followers":1717,"following":499,"likes":5339,"media_count":339,"name":"Pradeep Kapoor","description":"i test what ai can do, explain what matters, and ignore the boring parts, big fan anthropic - using claude 5x,","raw_description":{"text":"i test what ai can do, explain what matters, and ignore the boring parts, big fan anthropic - using claude 5x,","facets":[]},"location":"Gurgaon, India","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1920544183925817345/1786044706","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2081992949077061632/unnseZCr_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu May 08 18:20:00 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":tr